      "SeoDescription": "Diodes are devices that allow the flow of current in one direction and block current flow in the opposite direction. Types of diodes include current regulation, bridge rectifiers, RF, rectifier arrays, rectifiers, variable capacitance (varicaps, varactors), zener, zener arrays, and more.",
