          "SeoDescription": "Products within the single rectifier diode family are used to allow current flow in one direction only, and implement exactly one instance of this function per device package. Diodes used for other purposes (including zener and variable capacitance diodes) are listed separately in product families of their own, as are products incorporating multiple diodes per device package.",
